---
description: TypeScript code shape. Apply STYLE.md when writing or refactoring TS.
globs: "**/*.ts"
alwaysApply: false
---

Write TypeScript to [`STYLE.md`](../../STYLE.md). Coordinator classes use `init` (outside caller) and `new` (from props already on `this`). Endpoints stay a plain entry with module-private helpers.

Understand a class from its implementation. Open the sibling `Foo.test.ts` when changing tests.
